Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:56:12 +0000
Subject: ASP: in-game cheat list (fba_v52)

Hold Select + Down (pad: Select or minus + Down) for a second for the
console builds' cheat list, filled from FinalBurn Neo's own cheat engine:
per-game .ini files and the card's games' entries from cheat.dat, read
from hack/cheats/arcade/. Cheats with several settings step through them
with A. What is on is kept in <romset>.on and set again next start.

